LVFx5&_nc_oc=Adp8Rkm9JSBKtznKS096D5Y5JB7eCXa8TlobjwnWhj0Lp5zLEnkZvWLtIZoeMThjtt4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSlc__mAsBHPWyu56hOqlVqyzCPJC35wcT_f64r21NcwA&oe=6AFC6AB0"}, {"file_name": "picking_up_objects.png", "id": "3146461728839334", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393228_3146461732172667_3706287487870115736_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZJtwMPDOsCEQ7kNvwGXDL_B&_nc_oc=AdrxuiPE5GuKyn_YZV9xATHQ0XE5BXgNCy6AUKs65XcaiXgr7DiG_LjcfTTgCqQszxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTqR1vXiQduZNx5rsCFM8pRI_QwMyO2QAYP_CrmC9VjLA&oe=6AFC68BC"}, {"file_name": "multi_choice_example.png", "id": "3934472840166071", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391716_3934472846832737_5111795480125325401_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wUD2PB371c4Q7kNvwGvnMhV&_nc_oc=AdpSJzi5dPRyDA9pdwYQ7TfrVfkTlpBTrOXBVt3K7OnAGv4_14lFJxMIfLUnsbUU1BM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSL6XZdyQcufnKm4WBo2uACD6DItSStXeVcc6aARL9k5Q&oe=6AFC92AB"}, {"file_name": "countryside.png", "id": "829620639320570", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393545_829620645987236_1977403622736127236_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wan0jmhq53AQ7kNvwFVCNpJ&_nc_oc=AdoBM7hR3HF0sKR5ou86-NtXl0aT7qbFAQylnI5yeYrOEipIxn0SDrZAY_VwZgL4ZPs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSqMVYhJzlbztAiHACJraoxHuAmmVdU9hVj-GWY-DbmDg&oe=6AFC8C41"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "LingoVerse", "keywords": ["language", "adventure", "learning"], "long_description": "# Step into LingoVerse \u2013 The Ultimate German Learning Adventure!  \n\nLearning German has never been this immersive! **LingoVerse** takes language learning to the next level by placing you in interactive, fully voice-enabled environments where you can practice speaking with lifelike characters. Whether you\u2019re navigating a bustling city, exploring the countryside, cooking in a cozy kitchen, or sitting in a classroom, every interaction helps you improve your fluency in a fun and natural way.  \n\n## Key Features:  \n-  \ud83d\udde3 **Advanced Speech Recognition** with deep learning models\n- \ud83c\udf0d **Dynamic Environments** \u2013 Explore a **city**, the **countryside**, a **kitchen**, and a **classroom**, each designed to enhance different aspects of your language skills.  \n- \ud83c\udfae **Fun Minigames** \u2013 Boost your vocabulary by hunting for the right objects in each scene, reinforcing word associations in a hands-on way.  \n\n**Download LingoVerse now and step into fluency!** \ud83d\ude80\ud83c\udfa7  \n\n\n", "short_description": "LingoVerse transforms learning German into an immersive adventure! Step into vibrant environments filled with unique characters ready to chat with you in real-time conversations. Expand your vocabulary by interacting with objects around you, making learning both natural and intuitive. Whether you're a beginner or looking to sharpen your skills, LingoVerse makes mastering German both fun and effective!"}]}, "developer_name": "Laboratory for Computer Graphics and Multimedia at FRI-UL", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://doc-hosting.flycricket.io/lingoverse-privacy-policy/c32d666a-838b-4f25-bf17-22b14d5f5a3f/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://doc-hosting.flycricket.io/lingoverse-terms-of-use/31e9945d-b3d0-4d31-b6c9-9553dbaf1800/terms", "publisher_name": "Laboratory for Computer Graphics and Multimedia at FRI-UL", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://lgm.fri.uni-lj.si/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "26918901644604